{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The review write flow now rejects invalid ratings before persistence, distinguishes 403/409/404 cases, and binds updates to the URL’s review and product IDs. Rating aggregates are recalculated from the actual review rows after create/update/delete with one-decimal HALF_UP rounding, including zeroes after the last deletion."}}
